r"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Spellsinger is a series of fantasy novels written by Alan Dean Foster.","title":"Spellsinger"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" At present the series consists of eight books and, although there was a significant gap between the writing of book six and book seven, it seems unlikely that any more will be written.","title":"Spellsinger"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The AAnn are a fictional species of reptilians in Alan Dean Foster's Humanx Commonwealth series.","title":"List of Humanx Commonwealth races"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" They are described as lizard-like carnivores with flexibility and speed superior to that of most men, although they are generally shorter and somewhat weaker physically.","title":"List of Humanx Commonwealth races"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" They are covered in small scales and prefer hot, arid worlds with plenty of sand.","title":"List of Humanx Commonwealth races"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Phylogenesis (1999) is a science fiction novel by American writer Alan Dean Foster.","title":"Phylogenesis (novel)"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It is the first novel in Foster's "Founding of the Commonwealth Trilogy".","title":"Phylogenesis (novel)"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"Glory Lane (1987) is a science fiction novel written by Alan Dean Foster.","title":"Glory Lane"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" The book takes place outside of either of Foster’s two usual universes, Spellsinger and the Humanx Commonwealth.","title":"Glory Lane"},{"sentence_id":0,"text":"The Deluge Drivers (1987) is a science fiction novel by American writer Alan Dean Foster.","title":"The Deluge Drivers"},{"sentence_id":1,"text":" It is the final entry in Foster's "Icerigger Trilogy" of books taking place in the Humanx Commonwealth book series.","title":"The Deluge Drivers"},{"sentence_id":2,"text":" The two earlier books in the series are "Icerigger" and "Mission to Moulokin."","title":"The Deluge Drivers"}],"peer_messages":["Unverified peer answer: Samuel R. Delany
